                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At the \u201cWar Cry for Change\u201d press conference today, I joined @GruntStyleFdn, DAV, VFW, and General @RepJackBergman in demanding accountability and putting a stop to overprescription within the VA health system. Our veterans deserve better than a lifetime of pills, so I will continue fighting for alternative treatment pathways that provide our heros with the help they need without the risks of addiction.",
