                "text": "Broken and outdated computer systems have unreasonably delayed the delivery of benefits and health care for our veterans.\n\nThis week, I led an important oversight subcommittee hearing to review the VA's progress to modernize IT, use taxpayer dollars effectively, and deliver timely services to veterans.",
