                "text": "Michiganders shouldn\u2019t be forced to deal with poor air quality every summer because of Canada\u2019s inability to manage its forests. Our neighbors to the north need to get these wildfires under control before the risk to our public health gets any worse.\n\nhttps://t.co/6hGsm7PT49",
