                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I enjoyed hosting a health care town hall with various medical professionals from across mid-Michigan @Memorial_Owosso last week. I really appreciated their thoughtful questions and insight about how we can improve patient outcomes in our most rural communities. I look forward to continuing these conversations and supporting their important work as the historic $50 billion investment from the One Big Beautiful bill makes its way to our communities.",
