                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "AI is going to be a critical tool to help deliver health care to veterans in the 21st century. We must take the necessary steps to ensure we use it wisely and that we\u2019re protecting our veterans' data and information. Thank you to @michiganstateu\u2019s Dr. Mohammad Ghassemi for joining my @HouseVetAffairs Technology Modernization Subcommittee hearing today to discuss how AI can improve health care for veterans.",
