                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our veterans sacrificed for this country, and they deserve the certainty of knowing their benefits and services will not be cut off or interrupted. This week, I introduced the VA Extenders Act to maintain critical services: housing assistance, suicide prevention, health care initiatives, and more.",
