                "text": "The government shutdown is officially over. Now that this frustrating chapter is behind us, it\u2019s time to get serious about tackling the runaway cost of health care in our country and the other issues that are top of mind for families across Michigan.\n\nRead my full statement below. \u2b07\ufe0f",
